{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-48-1","title":"Isaiah 48:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God, to convince the people of their foreknown obstinancy, revealed his prophecies. 9 He saves them for his own sake. 12 He exhorts them to obedience, because of his power and providence. 16 He laments their backwardness. 20 He powerfully delivers his people out of Babylon.</p>\n<p>which are. Ge 32:28; 35:10; 2Ki 17:34; Joh 1:47; Ro 2:17,28,29; 9:6,8; Re 2:9 Re 3:9 come. Nu 24:7; De 33:28; Ps 68:26; Pr 5:16 which swear. 44:5; 45:23; 65:16; De 5:28; 6:13; 10:20; Ps 63:11; Zep 1:5 make mention. 26:13; 62:8; Ex 23:13 not in truth. 1:10-14; Le 19:12; Ps 50:16-20; 66:3; *marg: Jer 4:2; 5:2; 7:9,10; Mal 3:5; Mt 15:8,9; 23:14; Joh 4:24; 1Ti 4:2 2Ti 3:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-2","title":"Isaiah 48:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>they call. 52:1; 64:10,11; Ne 11:1,18; Ps 48:1; 87:3; Da 9:24; Mt 4:5; 27:53 Re 11:2; 21:2; 22:19 and stay. 10:20; Jud 17:13; 1Sa 4:3-5; Jer 7:4-11; 21:2; Mic 3:11 Joh 8:40,41; Ro 2:17 The Lord. 47:4; 51:13; Jer 10:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-3","title":"Isaiah 48:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>declared. 41:22; 42:9; 43:9; 44:7,8; 45:21; 46:9,10 and I. 10:12-19,33,34; 37:7,29,36-38; Jos 21:45; 23:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-4","title":"Isaiah 48:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I knew. 46:12; Ps 78:8; Zec 7:11,12 obstinate. Heb. hard. Jer 5:3; Eze 3:4-7; Da 5:20; Ro 2:5; Heb 3:13 and they. Ex 32:9; 33:3,5; De 10:16; 31:27; 2Ki 17:14; 2Ch 30:8; 36:13 Ne 9:16,17,28; Ps 75:5; Pr 29:1; Jer 7:26; 19:15; Zec 7:12; Ac 7:51 thy brow. Jer 3:3; Eze 3:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-5","title":"Isaiah 48:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>even. 3; 44:7; 46:10; Lu 1:70; Ac 15:18 Mine idol. 42:8,9; Jer 44:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-6","title":"Isaiah 48:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>hast heard. Ps 107:43; Jer 2:31; Mic 6:9 and will. 21:10; 43:8-10; Ps 40:9,10; 71:15-18; 78:3-6; 119:13; 145:4,5 Jer 50:2; Mt 10:27; Ac 1:8 shewed. 42:9; Da 12:8-13; Am 3:6; Joh 15:15; Ro 16:25,26; 1Co 2:9 1Pe 1:10-12; Re 1:19; 4:1; 5:1,2; 6:1-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-8","title":"Isaiah 48:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>thou heardest. 6:9,10; 26:11; 29:10,11; 42:19,20; Jer 5:21; Mt 13:13-15 Joh 12:39,40 thine ear. 50:5; Ps 40:6; 139:1-4; Jer 6:10 I knew. 4; 21:2; Jer 3:7-11,20; 5:11; Ho 5:7; 6:7; Mal 2:11 a transgressor. De 9:7-24; Ps 51:5; 58:3; Eze 16:3-5; Eph 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-9","title":"Isaiah 48:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>my name's. 11; 37:35; 43:25; Jos 7:9; 1Sa 12:22; Ps 25:11; 79:9; 106:8; 143:11 Jer 14:7; Eze 20:9,14,22,44; Da 9:17-19 defer. Ne 9:30,31; Ps 78:38; 103:8-10; Pr 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-10","title":"Isaiah 48:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I have refined. 1:25,26; Job 23:10; Ps 66:10; Pr 17:3; Jer 9:7; Eze 20:38 Eze 22:18-22; Zec 13:8,9; Mal 3:2,3; Heb 12:10,11; 1Pe 1:7; 4:12 Re 3:19 with silver. or, for silver. I have chosen. De 4:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-11","title":"Isaiah 48:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>mine own. 9 for how. 52:5; Nu 14:15,16; De 32:26,27; Eze 20:9,39; Ro 2:24 my name.{Shemi,} \"my name,\" is supplied by one MS. and the LXX.</p>\n<p>I will not. 5; 42:8; Joh 5:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-12","title":"Isaiah 48:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Hearken. 34:1; 46:3; 49:1; 51:1,4,7; 55:3; Pr 7:24; 8:32 O Jacob.Three MSS. and two old editions add {avdi,} \"my servant.\"</p>\n<p>my called. Mt 20:16; Ro 1:6; 8:28; 1Co 1:24; 1Pe 2:9; Re 17:14 I am he. 41:4; 44:6; De 32:39; Re 1:8,11,17,18; 2:8; 22:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-13","title":"Isaiah 48:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>hand. 42:5; 45:18; Ex 20:11; Ps 102:25; Heb 1:10-12 and. 40:12 my right hand hath spanned. or, the palm of my right handhath spread out. 40:22; Job 37:18 when. 40:26; Ps 119:89-91; 147:4; 148:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-14","title":"Isaiah 48:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>assemble. 41:22; 43:9; 44:7; 45:20,21 among them.Instead of {bahem,} \"among them,\" thirty-five MSS. and two editions have {bachem,} \"among you.\"</p>\n<p>The Lord.Rather, \"He whom the Lord hath loved, will execute his will on Babylon:\" that is, Cyrus.</p>\n<p>45:1-3; Mr 10:21 he will do. 13:4,5,17,18; 44:28; 46:11; Jer 50:21-29; 51:20-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-15","title":"Isaiah 48:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Jos 1:8; Ps 45:4; Eze 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-16","title":"Isaiah 48:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I have not. 3-6; 45:19; Joh 18:20 the Lord God. 11:1-5; 61:1-3; Zec 2:8-11; Lu 4:18; Joh 3:34; 20:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-17","title":"Isaiah 48:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the Lord. 20; 43:14; 44:6-24; 54:5 which teacheth. 2:3; 30:20; 54:13; De 8:17,18; 1Ki 8:36; Job 22:21,22; 36:22 Ps 25:8,9,12; 71:17; 73:24; Jer 31:33,34; Mic 4:2; Joh 6:45 Eph 4:21 which leadeth. 43:16; 49:9,10; Ps 32:8; Jer 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-18","title":"Isaiah 48:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>that thou. De 5:29; 32:29; Ps 81:13-16; Mt 23:37; Lu 19:41,42 then had. 32:15-18; 66:12; Ps 36:8; 119:165; Am 5:24; Ro 14:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-19","title":"Isaiah 48:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>seed. 10:22; Ge 13:16; 22:17; Jer 33:22; Ho 1:10; Ro 9:27 his name. 9; 9:14; 14:22; Jos 7:9; Ru 4:10; 1Ki 9:7; Ps 9:5; 109:13; Zep 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-20","title":"Isaiah 48:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>ye forth. 52:11; Jer 50:8; 51:6,45; Zec 2:6,7; Re 18:4 with a voice. 12:1; 26:1; 45:22,23; 49:13; 52:9; Ex 15:1-21; 19:4-6; Ps 126:1 Jer 31:12,13; 51:48; Re 18:20; 19:1-6 utter it even. 6; 2Sa 7:23; Jer 31:10; 50:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-21","title":"Isaiah 48:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>they thirsted. 30:25; 35:6,7; 41:17,18; 43:19,20; 49:10; Jer 31:9 he caused. Ex 17:6; Nu 20:11; Ne 9:15; Ps 78:15,20; 105:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-48-22","title":"Isaiah 48:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>57:21; Job 15:20-24; Lu 19:42; Ro 3:17</p>"}]}